ile/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fc/Lightslate_on_the_moon.png/revision/latest?cb=20260425213704\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"lightslate on the moon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/fc/Lightslate_on_the_moon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20260425213704\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"152\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Lightslate on the moon.png\" data-image-key=\"Lightslate_on_the_moon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Lightslate_on_the_moon.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><b>lightslate</b> on <b>the moon</b></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d2/Cloud.png/revision/latest?cb=20260425213131\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"the cloud which you may come across while ascending to the moon, just about half of the way to the moon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"81\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cloud.png\" data-image-key=\"Cloud.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d2/Cloud.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20260425213131\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d2/Cloud.png/revision/latest?cb=20260425213131\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"the cloud which you may come across while ascending to the moon, just about half of the way to the moon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d2/Cloud.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20260425213131\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"81\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Cloud.png\" data-image-key=\"Cloud.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d2/Cloud.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20260425213131\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Cloud.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\"><b>the cloud</b> which you may come across while ascending to the <b>moon,</b> just about half of the way to the <b>moon</b></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The moon is a location added for <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">April Fools 2025</a>. The moon is high in the sky above the <a href=\"/wiki/Bridge\" title=\"Bridge\">Bridge</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater\" title=\"Ferwater\">Ferwater</a>. You can get to the moon with the help of a <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Potion\" title=\"Mysterious Potion\">Mysterious Potion</a> with a 1% (?) chance, or by continously going up with a helicopter or preferably, a plane. oreless <a href=\"/wiki/Lightslate\" title=\"Lightslate\">Lightslate</a> abundantly appears on the moon, and during Easter <a href=\"/wiki/Eggs\" title=\"Eggs\">Moon Eggs</a>. there's a mostly transparent cloud you may and most likely will come across while on your way to the moon, weirdly enough you can frequently find grass on the cloud. the moon can still be found (last checked 2026-08-02)\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>(updated by: quandale scrip 2026-04-25)\n</p><p>(updated by:)\n</p><p>(updated by:)\n</p><p>(updated by:)\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903043242\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplicatio